## Local setup

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate   # or .venv\Scripts\activate on Windows
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```

Then open:
- http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
- http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health
- http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/candidates?cancer_type=PDAC&limit=5

## Sample scoring logic

The ranking engine computes a weighted composite score from:
- tumor specificity,
- off-target risk,
- surface accessibility,
- response signal,
- evidence strength.

This gives a transparent scoring model that can be extended to real multi-omics evidence and ML models.

